# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Next.js framework-generated agent files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Written and re-added by `next dev` via
# node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js
# These are deterministic framework artifacts, NOT FitOps architecture files.
# Narrow exception to the project's no-AGENTS.md policy: ONLY these two exact
# paths are ignored. Any other AGENTS.md anywhere in the repository must remain
# visible as an unintended artifact.
/frontend/AGENTS.md
/frontend/CLAUDE.md

